SUMMARY:PyData Berlin 2026 November Meetup
DESCRIPTION:PyData Berlin\nWelcome to the PyData Berlin November meetup!\n
 \n**Please register on Luma:** [https://luma.com/6q8mo2sp](https://luma.co
 m/6q8mo2sp)\nWe’re using Luma as the sole registration platform for this
  event. Please register through the link above to reserve your place. Meet
 up RSVPs won’t count as registration or guarantee a place\, so please do
 n’t RSVP on Meetup.\n\nPhotos may be taken during the event.\n\n\\*\\*\\
 *\nNumFOCUS **Code of Conduct**\nTHE SHORT VERSION\nBe kind to others. Do 
 not insult or put down others. Behave professionally. Remember that harass
 ment and sexist\, racist\, or exclusionary jokes are not appropriate for N
 umFOCUS.\nAll communication should be appropriate for a professional audie
 nce including people of many different backgrounds. Sexual language and im
 agery are not appropriate.\nNumFOCUS is dedicated to providing a harassmen
 t-free community for everyone\, regardless of gender\, sexual orientation\
 , gender identity\, and expression\, disability\, physical appearance\, bo
 dy size\, race\, or religion. We do not tolerate harassment of community m
 embers in any form.\nThank you for helping make this a welcoming\, friendl
 y community for all.\nIf you haven't yet\, please read the detailed versio
 n here: https://numfocus.org/code-of-conduct\n\\*\\*\\*
