SUMMARY:PyData Global 2026
DESCRIPTION:PyData Berlin\nPyData Global 2026 is a 2-day virtual event for
  the international community of data scientists\, data engineers\, and dev
 elopers of data analysis tools to share ideas and learn from each other.\n
 During the conference\, attendees will have the opportunity to attend live
  keynote sessions and talks\, lightning talks\, and get to know fellow mem
 bers of the PyData Community.\n\nhttps://pydata.org/global2026\n\nTo purch
 ase tickets: https://pydata.org/global2026/tickets\nSchedule: https://pret
 alx.com/pydata-global-2026/schedule/
